                     'mixing': 'the mixing structure between two bases', 'anomaly_sums': 'compatibility with the vanishing anomaly sums'},
    'scoring': 'PASS = 1 (checked by computation), DECLARED = 1/2 (holds with a named declared item), FAIL = 0, NONE = 0 (no such structure)',
    'candidates': cands,
